=== Summoned Weapons ===
While being NO RENT (see above), all summoned weapons are magic and can cause damage to mobs that require magic weapons, like ghouls and wisps.  Once magicians get a decent main hand weapon for themselves, though, most summoned weapons are relegated to pet use only.  Weapons can be given to pets at the lowest levels to make sure they can damage monsters that are immune to mundane weaponry, just like for yourself (or group-mates).  Also, at low levels, and before pets get dual wield, the summoned 2H staves' damage will be a bit higher than the pet's innate melee damage. Once pets get the innate ability to damage magical creatures, weapons can be used to allow them to dual wield. There is an argument to be made for giving them the Spear of Warding and a Dagger of Symbols for the resists, but +5 is not a lot.  It certainly would be rarely worth it if you are under any sort of time pressure to get ready.


